# November 18, 2026: West Hawaiʻi (the Kona and Kohala districts of Hawaiʻi Island), first pass on the Big Island.
# Region hi drawn at random by tools/choose.py. Facts come from the linked sources, opened in this session: Wikipedia
# (read with tools/wiki_raw.py), the Hawaii Division of State Parks page for each state park, the National Park Service
# hours and fee pages, the Daughters of Hawaii (Huliheʻe Palace), the Kona Historical Society (coffee farm) and the
# Mokuʻaikaua congregation's site. What could not be checked is said so in the entry.
# Every pin was looked at on the aerial and the bare-ground LiDAR sheet (tools/pincheck.py --lidar); see PIN_NOTES.
